+Its normalized real trace r_(x,ij) satisfies |r|<=1, and it acts only on cells{x,x+e_i,x+e_j}. Group the three pairs at anchor x. Every group fits the fixed four-cell shape Lambda0={0,e1,e2,e3}. Write
